### GET Request to example server
GET  http://localhost:8080

### All software engineers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineers

### One software engineer by id (404 if unknown, 400 if not a UUID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineers/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

### Insert new software engineer (201 Created, body echoes the generated id, Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anne",
  "techStack": ["java", "spring boot", "spring"]
}

### Update software engineer by id (200 OK, body echoes the updated entity; 404 if unknown, 400 if not a UUID or invalid)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineers/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anne Updated",
  "techStack": ["java", "spring boot", "spring", "postgres"]
}

### Delete software engineer by id (204 No Content; 404 if unknown, 400 if not a UUID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineers/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
